Approved cross-theme masters, receipts, and web builds produced by the
IconFlow method.

These are finished works published as evidence of what the IconFlow method
produces. They are not stock assets and not a free icon pack. No commercial
use, no derivatives, attribution required.

TO START YOUR OWN ICON, DO NOT COPY THESE
-----------------------------------------
Use `iconflow init` and `iconflow new <preset>`. The technique scaffolds in
../templates/presets/ are CC0 public domain and exist for exactly this purpose,
so whatever you design from them is unencumbered and yours.

The IconFlow name and mark carry trademark obligations that no copyright
license grants. See ../TRADEMARKS.md and ../LICENSES.md.
